WEBVTT

01:20.860 --> 01:26.730
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.360 --> 01:29.720
[Episode 19]

01:32.640 --> 01:33.560
Mother.

01:35.280 --> 01:36.370
Mother, what's the matter?

01:36.370 --> 01:38.500
Why did you call me here in such a hurry?

01:39.789 --> 01:40.920
You may leave first.

01:41.789 --> 01:42.479
Yes.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.350
Yesterday,

01:53.870 --> 01:54.840
Zhao came to me,

01:55.640 --> 01:56.840
saying the Ji family

01:56.920 --> 01:59.180
wants back those 20,000 taels of silver.

01:59.200 --> 02:01.070
What 20,000 taels of silver?

02:03.150 --> 02:04.470
Those 20,000 taels.

02:05.770 --> 02:08.960
-15 years ago...
-20 years ago.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.470
Right, right.

02:10.889 --> 02:12.090
I completely forgot.

02:13.000 --> 02:14.840
But why would the Ji family

02:14.840 --> 02:16.520
suddenly remember this now?

02:17.470 --> 02:18.310
I guess

02:18.910 --> 02:21.280
someone close to Ji Han told them.

02:22.840 --> 02:24.140
What did Zhao say?

02:24.240 --> 02:25.360
I played dumb

02:25.960 --> 02:27.490
and said I didn't remember.

02:28.150 --> 02:30.190
But there was an IOU back then.

02:31.710 --> 02:33.150
It's been 20 years now.

02:33.360 --> 02:34.290
I was just hoping

02:34.310 --> 02:36.370
they wouldn't be able to find the IOU.

02:39.710 --> 02:42.840
This matter must not be made public.

02:44.000 --> 02:46.180
The position of
Vice Minister of Personnel is vacant,

02:46.180 --> 02:48.310
and I'm currently maneuvering for it.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.890
At this critical juncture,

02:50.000 --> 02:52.090
we can't afford any complications.

02:52.110 --> 02:53.630
Of course I know that.

02:55.120 --> 02:56.190
But that Zhao

02:57.120 --> 02:59.450
is clearly not someone to be trifled with.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.160
The Yao family is coming soon

03:04.240 --> 03:05.910
to check Lian's dowry list.

03:07.030 --> 03:07.910
As for you,

03:08.800 --> 03:10.080
think carefully.

03:11.710 --> 03:12.710
This matter

03:13.360 --> 03:14.960
is a hidden danger after all.

03:26.079 --> 03:26.840
Mother.

03:29.400 --> 03:30.060
Mother.

03:30.240 --> 03:31.000
This

03:31.000 --> 03:32.680
is Lian's dowry list.

03:33.079 --> 03:34.190
Let me read it to you

03:34.470 --> 03:36.280
so you can see if it's appropriate.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.840
Go ahead, I'm listening.

03:42.079 --> 03:42.680
Old Madam,

03:42.800 --> 03:44.130
Madam Yao is at the door.

03:45.190 --> 03:45.800
Please invite her in quickly.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.190
Yes.

03:49.000 --> 03:51.000
People from the Yao family are here.

03:51.400 --> 03:52.470
This marriage

03:52.490 --> 03:53.520
is settled.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.130
That's what he said?

04:00.310 --> 04:00.970
Where is he?

04:01.590 --> 04:02.870
I was afraid he might run
into someone from the Yao family,

04:02.870 --> 04:04.560
so I led him to Zhao's courtyard.

04:04.560 --> 04:05.890
You did the right thing.

04:06.960 --> 04:07.470
Mother.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.260
The Ji family has come

04:09.260 --> 04:10.420
to ask for the money.

04:11.190 --> 04:12.850
Why did they come so suddenly?

04:14.030 --> 04:14.960
Here's the plan.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.390
I'll go to Zhao's place.

04:16.420 --> 04:18.120
You handle things here for now.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.430
Don't be rude.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.870
Thank you for your trouble, Mother.

04:20.870 --> 04:22.240
Mother, where are you going?

04:22.240 --> 04:23.240
Yeah, Grandmother.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.630
Madam Yao is about to arrive.

04:24.630 --> 04:25.560
How can you leave?

04:25.560 --> 04:26.420
That's enough.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.560
This dowry list

04:31.750 --> 04:32.720
has some issues.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.900
I'll think about it some more.

04:35.750 --> 04:37.240
You two

04:37.310 --> 04:38.600
entertain them for now.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.480
Master, what's wrong with it?

04:40.480 --> 04:42.080
Wasn't this all agreed upon?

04:43.360 --> 04:45.960
Is your stay at
your ancestral home going well?

04:47.110 --> 04:48.440
Second Young Master Ji.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.850
I pay my respects to you, Old Madam.

05:00.920 --> 05:02.450
I haven't seen you in years.

05:03.040 --> 05:05.240
You've grown into a handsome young man.

05:05.390 --> 05:06.850
You flatter me, Old Madam.

05:07.270 --> 05:08.310
We are relatives,

05:08.950 --> 05:11.280
so there's no need
to beat around the bush.

05:11.630 --> 05:12.920
I don't remember

05:13.310 --> 05:15.240
borrowing money from your family.

05:21.560 --> 05:22.960
It's been over ten years.

05:23.430 --> 05:25.750
It's understandable
if you've forgotten.

05:25.750 --> 05:26.950
Take a look at the IOU.

05:27.040 --> 05:28.570
You might just remember it.

05:32.430 --> 05:33.360
This was found among

05:33.360 --> 05:34.480
my aunt's belongings.

05:34.420 --> 05:35.750
[IOU]

05:35.120 --> 05:36.070
Twenty years ago,

05:36.070 --> 05:36.870
you borrowed 20,000 taels of silver

05:36.870 --> 05:38.159
from my aunt.

05:38.630 --> 05:40.070
With a three percent interest rate,

05:40.070 --> 05:41.430
to be repaid within a year.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.430
Here is your seal.

05:43.550 --> 05:44.670
[IOU]

05:49.510 --> 05:50.800
What IOU?

05:51.630 --> 05:53.070
I know nothing about it.

05:53.890 --> 05:55.540
But your seal is on it.

05:56.390 --> 05:58.000
That is the strange part.

05:59.270 --> 06:01.370
It is indeed my seal on it.

06:01.510 --> 06:02.710
But I know absolutely

06:03.510 --> 06:05.040
nothing about this matter.

06:10.430 --> 06:11.600
Are you saying

06:12.160 --> 06:13.720
that you refuse to acknowledge

06:13.720 --> 06:14.720
this IOU?

06:30.510 --> 06:31.960
The tea has gone weak.

06:32.159 --> 06:32.830
I have

06:32.830 --> 06:34.480
a lot of things
waiting for me at my estate.

06:33.940 --> 06:36.150
[Madam Yao, Yao Ping's wife]

06:35.040 --> 06:36.510
I wonder how long it will take

06:36.510 --> 06:38.310
for the Old Madam to return.

06:39.870 --> 06:41.310
She should be here soon.

06:42.750 --> 06:43.870
We shouldn't have kept you

06:43.870 --> 06:45.390
waiting for so long.

06:45.870 --> 06:48.659
But the family that had the incident

06:48.750 --> 06:50.750
is the Old Madam's maternal family,

06:51.000 --> 06:54.240
so she has to handle it herself.

06:55.510 --> 06:57.720
She should be back any minute now.

06:59.680 --> 07:00.930
Go and see

07:01.160 --> 07:02.570
where the Old Madam is.

07:03.390 --> 07:04.070
Yes.

07:07.350 --> 07:08.680
What do you mean by that?

07:09.240 --> 07:10.370
Are you trying to say

07:10.510 --> 07:11.630
that I want to dodge

07:11.630 --> 07:12.230
your debt?

07:13.070 --> 07:14.510
A mere 20,000 taels

07:14.920 --> 07:15.720
is not something our Gu family

07:15.720 --> 07:17.240
would even care about.

07:18.920 --> 07:20.000
It's just that I

07:20.070 --> 07:22.040
did not borrow this money.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.240
We are relatives.

07:24.600 --> 07:25.160
I won't

07:25.390 --> 07:27.390
blame you for being disrespectful.

07:28.270 --> 07:30.000
You should leave immediately.

07:30.160 --> 07:31.420
I should head back too.

07:32.610 --> 07:34.560
I didn't expect the dignified Gu family

07:34.560 --> 07:35.720
to be like this.

07:37.630 --> 07:38.680
Yao.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.270
Am I wrong?

07:41.240 --> 07:42.180
On this IOU,

07:42.390 --> 07:44.800
it is clearly written in black and white.

07:45.520 --> 07:47.850
The seals and fingerprints are all there.

07:47.920 --> 07:50.430
Can your grandmother just deny it
and be done with it?

07:50.430 --> 07:51.960
How can there be such logic?

07:54.630 --> 07:56.430
Grandmother is advanced in age.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.190
It is common for her to forget

07:58.190 --> 07:59.240
some things.

08:00.160 --> 08:01.070
Yao,

08:01.190 --> 08:02.680
talk to her nicely.

08:03.070 --> 08:03.930
My grandmother

08:03.940 --> 08:05.620
is not someone who plays dumb.

08:06.040 --> 08:06.550
Right?

08:07.060 --> 08:08.660
I have never seen this IOU.

08:09.270 --> 08:10.080
Perhaps

08:10.430 --> 08:12.100
you had it forged.

08:12.360 --> 08:13.310
Forged?

08:16.190 --> 08:17.480
Our Ji family,

08:17.800 --> 08:19.390
for 20,000 taels,

08:19.920 --> 08:22.300
needs to forge an IOU to extort you?

08:22.560 --> 08:23.830
What a huge joke.

08:27.040 --> 08:27.950
I did not expect

08:28.240 --> 08:30.040
the family of an imperial censor

08:30.040 --> 08:31.840
to have such a family tradition.

08:32.390 --> 08:33.049
Never mind.

08:33.870 --> 08:35.270
Since you won't admit it,

08:36.120 --> 08:36.890
I will just have to

08:36.890 --> 08:38.890
take a trip to Shuntian Prefecture.

08:39.630 --> 08:40.230
Come back!

08:40.240 --> 08:41.120
Yao.

08:42.150 --> 08:42.789
Grandmother has already

08:42.789 --> 08:44.120
remembered this money.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.080
Right?

08:50.720 --> 08:51.870
So you remember now?

08:53.960 --> 08:55.080
Why are you acting

08:55.320 --> 08:56.790
so rashly, child?

08:57.360 --> 08:58.960
The matter hasn't been clarified yet.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.870
Why jump straight to Shuntian Prefecture?

09:00.870 --> 09:02.530
You are being too aggressive.

09:03.440 --> 09:04.040
Old Madam,

09:04.750 --> 09:06.550
I am not trying to be aggressive.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.150
In the past,

09:08.630 --> 09:09.840
for my aunt's sake,

09:10.360 --> 09:11.550
let alone 20,000 taels,

09:11.550 --> 09:13.270
even 40,000 or 80,000 taels,

09:13.910 --> 09:14.870
we wouldn't have

09:14.870 --> 09:16.530
held it against the Gu family.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.670
But now,

09:18.870 --> 09:20.670
not only has my aunt passed away,

09:21.240 --> 09:23.300
she was also divorced from Gu Dezhao.

09:23.390 --> 09:25.630
Our families have nothing
to do with each other anymore.

09:25.630 --> 09:26.390
Besides,

09:28.150 --> 09:30.270
I haven't forgotten

09:32.150 --> 09:33.150
why my aunt died.

09:37.480 --> 09:38.750
I must collect

09:39.030 --> 09:40.720
this debt today.

09:41.440 --> 09:42.040
Old Madam,

09:42.550 --> 09:44.610
if you have any doubts about the debt,

09:44.720 --> 09:46.520
let's go to Shuntian Prefecture

09:46.750 --> 09:47.750
and make it clear.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.200
We are in-laws.

09:51.870 --> 09:52.670
It wasn't necessary to make a scene

09:52.670 --> 09:53.910
like this.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.480
Go back and ask the Second Madam

09:57.670 --> 09:59.270
and have her check carefully

09:59.360 --> 10:01.080
to see if there is such a debt.

10:01.240 --> 10:01.750
Yes.

10:10.430 --> 10:11.110
Master.

10:13.510 --> 10:14.970
Sorry to keep you waiting.

10:16.670 --> 10:17.240
Dear.

10:28.330 --> 10:30.120
[Dowry Silver: 2,000 Taels]

10:32.760 --> 10:35.370
[Dowry Silver: 2,000 Taels]

10:48.000 --> 10:49.670
What's wrong, in-law?

10:50.360 --> 10:53.360
Is there anything inappropriate?

10:54.660 --> 10:56.060
Nothing inappropriate.

10:57.630 --> 10:59.720
It's just my first time seeing

10:59.910 --> 11:01.960
so little dowry money.

11:02.270 --> 11:04.110
It just feels a bit

11:04.440 --> 11:05.440
strange.

11:07.670 --> 11:08.670
Nothing.

11:09.390 --> 11:10.840
Let's stop here for today.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.910
I'm heading back.

11:13.000 --> 11:14.130
No need to see me out.

11:16.300 --> 11:17.370
Take care.

11:19.720 --> 11:20.670
Well, this...

11:20.910 --> 11:22.310
What kind of talk is that?

11:22.480 --> 11:24.010
Is 20,000 taels too little?

11:24.030 --> 11:24.830
Exactly.

11:25.030 --> 11:25.630
I don't believe

11:25.630 --> 11:27.200
that when she married into the Yao family,

11:27.200 --> 11:28.910
she had more dowry money than me.

11:28.910 --> 11:30.360
And she still looks down on me?

11:30.360 --> 11:31.390
Unbelievable.

11:32.750 --> 11:34.670
I changed the dowry money

11:35.440 --> 11:37.000
to 2,000 taels.

11:41.750 --> 11:42.670
What?

11:43.670 --> 11:44.550
Father!

11:45.670 --> 11:46.510
Master,

11:46.550 --> 11:48.260
what are you doing?

11:49.120 --> 11:50.080
What am I doing?

11:50.670 --> 11:51.850
Paying debts.

11:53.550 --> 11:54.480
What debts?

11:57.750 --> 11:59.010
You don't need to know.

12:03.530 --> 12:05.060
Why, Father?

12:05.190 --> 12:06.670
Why are you using my money

12:06.670 --> 12:07.750
to pay off the debt?

12:07.840 --> 12:09.510
What do you mean, your money?

12:09.720 --> 12:12.120
It all belongs to the Gu family.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.810
I'm going to tell Grandmother.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.480
That's my dowry money.

12:16.480 --> 12:19.030
I'm going to tell Grandmother right now!

12:22.790 --> 12:25.000
If you dare bother your grandmother,

12:26.080 --> 12:27.340
I'll beat you to death.

12:31.360 --> 12:33.200
Will you keep the bank notes,

12:33.360 --> 12:35.320
or should I deposit them
in the bank for you?

12:35.320 --> 12:36.150
No need to give it to me.

12:36.150 --> 12:37.910
This is the Ji family's money.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.120
That won't do.

12:39.790 --> 12:41.430
This is Aunt's dowry money,

12:41.600 --> 12:43.330
so it should be returned to you.

12:44.150 --> 12:45.750
Then keep it for me for now.

12:46.630 --> 12:48.200
There are too many prying eyes here.

12:48.200 --> 12:50.860
I'm afraid it will attract
unwanted attention.

12:51.030 --> 12:51.670
Alright.

12:52.960 --> 12:54.490
This was a real eye-opener.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.670
This Gu family

12:55.790 --> 12:57.110
is rotten to the core.

13:01.080 --> 13:01.750
Otherwise,

13:02.080 --> 13:03.960
you should come back to Tongzhou with me.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.840
With you staying here,

13:04.840 --> 13:05.970
I'm really worried.

13:06.080 --> 13:07.010
That won't work.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.270
I have my own plans.

13:09.790 --> 13:11.230
Don't worry.

13:11.750 --> 13:13.200
Even though the people here

13:13.200 --> 13:14.270
look fierce,

13:14.550 --> 13:15.680
their little tricks

13:15.870 --> 13:16.910
are nothing to me.

13:19.510 --> 13:21.870
Are you still thinking
about going to Shanxi?

13:21.870 --> 13:22.360
I advise you

13:22.360 --> 13:23.620
to give up on that idea.

13:23.670 --> 13:25.330
Look at you, here you go again.

13:25.390 --> 13:27.120
I didn't say I'd definitely go.

13:27.750 --> 13:28.910
I was just wondering

13:29.150 --> 13:30.270
if that might be

13:30.270 --> 13:31.360
a way out for me.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.910
If not, I won't go.

13:38.080 --> 13:39.480
My good Yao,

13:39.790 --> 13:41.270
stop worrying about me.

13:41.670 --> 13:42.870
I know what I'm doing.

13:49.320 --> 13:50.080
Alright.

13:50.750 --> 13:53.210
I've never been
able to convince you anyway.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.370
Just one thing.

13:55.870 --> 13:57.600
Don't let yourself be wronged.

13:57.960 --> 13:58.840
I know.

13:59.150 --> 14:04.260
[Generations of Excellence]

13:59.630 --> 14:00.200
Let's go.

14:08.910 --> 14:09.630
Lian.

14:10.960 --> 14:12.080
Lian!

14:16.000 --> 14:17.370
What are you doing?

14:17.510 --> 14:19.050
That was my dowry money.

14:19.120 --> 14:21.030
Why did it have to go to Gu Jinzhao?

14:21.390 --> 14:22.860
I'm going to ask Grandmother

14:22.860 --> 14:24.590
what is going on.

14:26.550 --> 14:27.440
Leave us.

14:30.390 --> 14:32.440
Haven't you embarrassed yourself enough?

14:32.440 --> 14:33.850
What's the use of going?

14:34.320 --> 14:37.250
The money has already
been returned to the Ji family.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.320
Mother,

14:39.120 --> 14:40.360
what should I do?

14:41.240 --> 14:42.080
The Yao family has

14:42.080 --> 14:43.870
three sisters-in-law above me.

14:43.870 --> 14:45.000
On the day of the dowry display,

14:45.000 --> 14:47.200
I'll definitely be laughed at.

14:47.840 --> 14:48.960
I know.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.480
It's fine.

14:53.150 --> 14:54.000
Back then,

14:54.120 --> 14:56.000
when the fourth branch
split from the family,

14:56.000 --> 14:57.080
your Fourth Aunt

14:57.150 --> 14:58.510
left quite a few things

14:58.510 --> 14:59.910
in the storehouse.

15:00.750 --> 15:01.440
When the time comes,

15:01.440 --> 15:03.080
I'll add a few to your dowry.

15:05.750 --> 15:06.470
Really?

15:06.750 --> 15:08.970
Are Fourth Aunt's things

15:09.200 --> 15:10.360
really that good?

15:11.550 --> 15:14.390
She was the daughter
of Tongzhou's richest man.

15:15.480 --> 15:16.960
Zhao also has money.

15:19.560 --> 15:21.910
Aren't you going to the silk shop tomorrow

15:22.080 --> 15:23.810
to pick out fabric for clothes?

15:25.030 --> 15:26.730
Go to Zhao's shop,

15:27.030 --> 15:29.610
and invite her along.

15:30.000 --> 15:32.530
Let's see if she has
the nerve to ask you to pay.

15:33.720 --> 15:34.510
All right.

15:35.150 --> 15:36.870
I also want to check out
Linxia Restaurant.

15:36.870 --> 15:37.360
Anyway,

15:37.360 --> 15:38.960
I've never been there before.

15:38.960 --> 15:40.150
Then go.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.750
As an older sister,

15:43.910 --> 15:45.120
it's only right that

15:45.120 --> 15:46.080
she treats you to a meal

15:46.080 --> 15:47.340
in her own restaurant.

15:48.080 --> 15:48.630
Okay.

15:49.670 --> 15:53.220
[Western Regions Tribute Hide]

15:53.250 --> 15:57.790
[Linxia Restaurant]

15:57.270 --> 15:57.860
Boss.

16:00.360 --> 16:02.390
There's no one in your restaurant.

16:02.510 --> 16:03.890
Business is slow.

16:04.030 --> 16:05.030
No wonder

16:05.630 --> 16:08.000
you charged me for a few clothes.

16:09.910 --> 16:11.320
Did someone book the whole place?

16:11.320 --> 16:12.480
You guessed it.

16:12.510 --> 16:13.240
Early this morning,

16:13.240 --> 16:15.080
you sent someone to reserve a room,

16:15.080 --> 16:16.670
and then a distinguished guest came,

16:16.670 --> 16:18.030
wanting to book

16:18.030 --> 16:18.960
the entire restaurant.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.830
I told them you had a reservation,

16:20.960 --> 16:23.020
so they only booked the second floor.

16:23.080 --> 16:23.830
But I

16:23.910 --> 16:25.790
didn't dare take any other guests.

16:25.790 --> 16:27.510
What kind of distinguished guest

16:27.510 --> 16:29.720
books the whole place at once?

16:34.600 --> 16:35.510
Third Master is here,

16:35.510 --> 16:36.830
and the others are here too.

16:36.780 --> 16:43.350
[Linxia Restaurant]

16:37.200 --> 16:38.120
Boss, please.

16:39.360 --> 16:40.720
What is it?

16:40.720 --> 16:42.000
So mysterious.

16:52.670 --> 16:54.200
This dish is a bit too salty.

16:54.670 --> 16:55.800
I need to freshen up.

17:00.120 --> 17:01.650
You don't need to follow me.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.010
What kind of big shot is this,

17:14.109 --> 17:15.640
sneaking around like this?

17:16.400 --> 17:17.480
Could it be

17:17.510 --> 17:19.440
some shady business?

17:24.510 --> 17:25.599
What are you doing?

17:25.710 --> 17:27.720
You shouldn't go to the second floor.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.580
Go back with me.

17:31.030 --> 17:31.920
Then tell me,

17:32.320 --> 17:33.920
who is the big shot upstairs?

17:35.150 --> 17:36.410
You don't need to know.

17:36.430 --> 17:38.310
It won't do you any good even if you know.

17:38.310 --> 17:39.000
Come with me.

17:39.000 --> 17:39.930
I'm not leaving.

17:41.070 --> 17:42.830
Why are you being so secretive?

17:43.000 --> 17:44.030
Could the person upstairs

17:44.030 --> 17:45.360
be the Emperor himself?

17:45.680 --> 17:46.590
The Emperor would never come

17:46.590 --> 17:48.120
to your shabby little shop.

17:49.070 --> 17:49.880
Who is it?

17:52.590 --> 17:53.720
Greetings, My Lord.

17:55.480 --> 17:57.740
Are you a waitress of Linxia Restaurant?

17:59.070 --> 17:59.590
My Lord,

17:59.830 --> 18:01.720
this is the boss of our shop.

18:02.790 --> 18:03.550
The boss?

18:03.550 --> 18:04.070
Yes.

18:06.310 --> 18:08.370
Won't the boss come and offer a toast?

18:10.160 --> 18:10.920
Well...

18:11.310 --> 18:12.160
Mr. Gao,

18:12.550 --> 18:13.720
go get

18:13.920 --> 18:14.580
my wine cup.

18:15.000 --> 18:16.030
Yes, Boss.

18:17.400 --> 18:19.160
You are absolutely right, My Lord.

18:19.160 --> 18:20.440
I was just about to go over

18:20.440 --> 18:21.440
and offer a toast.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.070
Hurry up.

18:27.270 --> 18:27.920
Go back.

18:29.750 --> 18:30.810
I'm not going back.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.400
I want to offer a toast too.

18:32.400 --> 18:32.880
What?

18:33.070 --> 18:34.030
Are you the only one allowed

18:34.030 --> 18:35.830
to socialize with the powerful?

18:36.550 --> 18:38.160
You asked for this.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.790
When Grandmother and Second Aunt

18:39.790 --> 18:40.920
ask about it later,

18:41.240 --> 18:42.100
don't blame me.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.690
Of course I won't blame you.

18:55.000 --> 18:55.510
Come in.

19:11.590 --> 19:12.680
Mr. Yao?

19:12.750 --> 19:13.310
My Lord.

19:15.720 --> 19:16.640
Lian?

19:17.240 --> 19:18.830
W-Why are you here?

19:18.960 --> 19:20.070
I... I... I...

19:20.270 --> 19:22.000
I... I don't know either.

19:22.440 --> 19:24.590
I... I went the wrong way.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.200
Why did she leave?

19:30.510 --> 19:31.160
Lord Yao.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.000
You know her?

19:42.750 --> 19:43.510
My respects

19:43.750 --> 19:44.960
to Third Master

19:46.200 --> 19:47.030
and all lords.

19:48.880 --> 19:50.020
My surname is Gu.

19:50.310 --> 19:52.240
I am the boss of Linxia Restaurant.

19:52.400 --> 19:53.200
I heard

19:53.480 --> 19:55.350
you were honoring us
with your presence today,

19:55.350 --> 19:56.980
so I came to pay my respects.

19:57.160 --> 19:58.220
Your surname is Gu?

19:58.480 --> 19:59.920
Isn't this Linxia Restaurant

19:59.920 --> 20:02.250
the property of the Ji family in Tongzhou?

20:02.480 --> 20:03.880
I wouldn't dare deceive you, My Lord.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.160
The head of the Ji family

20:05.160 --> 20:06.760
is my maternal grandmother.

20:08.510 --> 20:09.200
Jiuheng.

20:09.750 --> 20:11.590
According to what she says,

20:12.240 --> 20:13.110
she works for you.

20:13.110 --> 20:14.370
Aren't you her master?

20:15.640 --> 20:16.400
I suppose so.

20:18.680 --> 20:19.280
By the way,

20:19.640 --> 20:20.570
why are you here?

20:20.750 --> 20:21.680
Third Master,

20:22.440 --> 20:24.310
my grandmother entrusted Linxia Restaurant

20:24.310 --> 20:25.350
to my care.

20:25.790 --> 20:27.270
So every now and then,

20:27.270 --> 20:28.400
I come to check on it.

20:28.750 --> 20:29.590
Today

20:29.830 --> 20:31.160
is quite a coincidence.

20:33.880 --> 20:34.920
Whatever you two have to say,

20:34.920 --> 20:36.110
save it for later.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.110
Miss Gu,

20:38.880 --> 20:39.960
didn't you say

20:40.790 --> 20:42.520
you were going to offer a toast?

20:45.000 --> 20:45.750
Yes.

20:51.200 --> 20:53.060
Thank you for your care, my lords.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.480
I would like

20:54.880 --> 20:56.160
to offer you a toast.

21:02.350 --> 21:04.080
I won't disturb you any longer.

21:04.110 --> 21:06.110
I will take my leave now.

21:08.750 --> 21:09.510
Wait.

21:12.400 --> 21:13.800
Did I say you could leave?

21:14.830 --> 21:16.750
You just said you drop by

21:16.750 --> 21:18.680
Linxia Restaurant every so often.

21:19.790 --> 21:20.510
We've been here

21:20.510 --> 21:21.680
so many times,

21:21.750 --> 21:22.680
but we've never seen you

21:22.680 --> 21:24.010
come over and say hello.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.440
Are you intentionally

21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
avoiding us?

21:28.790 --> 21:29.720
How could I?

21:30.310 --> 21:31.510
It's just that

21:31.790 --> 21:33.680
I was worried you were discussing

21:33.680 --> 21:34.680
court secrets,

21:34.960 --> 21:36.400
so I didn't dare to disturb you.

21:36.400 --> 21:37.720
Look at this.

21:37.960 --> 21:40.160
That sounds like a perfunctory excuse.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.210
But never mind.

21:41.350 --> 21:41.880
You,

21:42.750 --> 21:43.680
pour the wine.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.130
A penalty drink.

21:50.000 --> 21:50.640
Pour.

21:55.790 --> 21:57.090
You are right, My Lord.

21:57.640 --> 21:58.300
I should...

21:58.400 --> 22:00.460
-drink a penalty cup.
-Wait.

22:02.350 --> 22:03.880
One cup isn't enough.

22:04.710 --> 22:06.380
With so many of us here,

22:06.830 --> 22:08.690
one cup isn't quite appropriate.

22:09.580 --> 22:10.540
Three cups.

22:14.400 --> 22:15.110
Yuanweng.

22:17.070 --> 22:18.130
Speaking of which,

22:18.480 --> 22:19.540
she may be the boss,

22:20.160 --> 22:22.440
but she's just a young girl.

22:22.750 --> 22:23.440
How about

22:24.350 --> 22:25.280
I drink with you?

22:27.860 --> 22:30.320
Jiuheng is being tender and protective.

22:39.310 --> 22:41.440
I wouldn't dare trouble Third Master.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.380
What you say is right, My Lord.

22:43.640 --> 22:44.970
It was my negligence.

22:45.070 --> 22:46.590
How can punishing myself
with one cup be enough?

22:46.590 --> 22:47.610
I should indeed

22:47.720 --> 22:49.380
drink three cups as a penalty.

23:06.480 --> 23:08.270
Good. How forthright.

23:08.750 --> 23:10.880
You really have quite a spirit.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.880
Good, good.

23:14.200 --> 23:15.600
You are as good as any man.

23:15.720 --> 23:18.380
She is the boss
of Linxia Restaurant, after all.

23:20.110 --> 23:22.220
Then I shall excuse myself first.

23:22.550 --> 23:23.810
I won't spoil your fun.

23:44.270 --> 23:44.830
My Lady.

23:46.920 --> 23:48.590
It's fine. I'm not drunk.

23:49.680 --> 23:50.270
You may leave.

23:50.270 --> 23:51.400
I am fine, Mr. Gao.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.210
Yes, My Lady.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.910
Call me if you need anything.

23:57.640 --> 23:58.200
Do you want me to

23:58.200 --> 24:00.000
pour you a bowl of hangover soup?

24:00.550 --> 24:01.240
It's fine.

24:02.350 --> 24:03.150
Where is Lian?

24:03.750 --> 24:04.920
I was just about to tell you.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.720
Earlier, Miss Lian

24:05.720 --> 24:06.790
said she had to leave
as soon as she got back,

24:06.790 --> 24:07.990
and has already left.

24:08.960 --> 24:09.920
Do you know

24:09.960 --> 24:10.890
who she ran into?

24:11.200 --> 24:11.750
Who?

24:12.510 --> 24:13.830
Yao Wenxiu's father,

24:14.070 --> 24:15.550
Yao Ping, Lord Yao.

24:17.550 --> 24:18.350
Third Master.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.380
Greetings, Third Master.

24:29.110 --> 24:29.750
How is it?

24:30.310 --> 24:31.640
Are you uncomfortable?

24:34.510 --> 24:36.640
Linxia Restaurant is elegant and quiet.

24:36.640 --> 24:38.240
My mentor likes it very much,

24:38.310 --> 24:39.750
and also loves to call for some

24:39.750 --> 24:41.240
singing girls for company.

24:41.240 --> 24:43.040
But I don't care for such things.

24:46.160 --> 24:48.070
It doesn't matter even if you do.

24:48.640 --> 24:50.570
I am the boss of Linxia Restaurant.

24:50.750 --> 24:51.760
I've seen

24:52.000 --> 24:53.600
plenty of this sort of thing.

24:55.510 --> 24:57.310
I shouldn't have stopped you just now.

24:57.310 --> 24:58.680
With Wang Xuanfan's temper,

24:58.680 --> 25:00.240
the more I try to stop him,
the more he insists.

25:00.240 --> 25:00.830
Instead,

25:00.880 --> 25:02.140
he made you drink a lot.

25:02.310 --> 25:03.770
You don't need to explain.

25:04.680 --> 25:05.400
As for me,

25:05.480 --> 25:06.810
I didn't drink too much.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.680
And I have a very high tolerance.

25:11.920 --> 25:12.720
Are you

25:13.030 --> 25:14.310
not angry at all?

25:16.440 --> 25:18.160
You are a Grand Secretary.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.590
Daily social engagements

25:19.590 --> 25:20.550
are common.

25:21.720 --> 25:22.510
Besides,

25:22.960 --> 25:23.680
your coming here

25:23.680 --> 25:25.070
is to support my business.

25:25.070 --> 25:26.310
Why would I be angry?

25:30.200 --> 25:31.110
I think

25:31.110 --> 25:32.640
you'd better go back early.

25:32.720 --> 25:34.050
Don't stay out too long,

25:34.240 --> 25:35.030
or else

25:35.160 --> 25:36.760
it might cause more trouble.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.410
I'll take my leave.

25:47.200 --> 25:48.000
Third Master.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.550
Miss Gu looks like

25:49.960 --> 25:51.290
she is really not angry.

25:53.440 --> 25:54.590
Really not angry?

25:55.590 --> 25:57.720
She isn't angry, right?

25:58.590 --> 25:59.650
You have a good eye.

26:05.640 --> 26:06.570
Is she not angry?

26:06.900 --> 26:07.830
She isn't angry.

26:16.440 --> 26:17.000
Jiuheng.

26:17.590 --> 26:18.120
Jiuheng.

26:18.200 --> 26:19.680
Jiu... Jiu... Jiuheng.

26:20.590 --> 26:21.310
We...

26:21.400 --> 26:23.130
We were just talking about you,

26:23.270 --> 26:23.870
wondering

26:24.440 --> 26:25.440
why you

26:25.440 --> 26:27.770
haven't taken a woman into your house yet.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.270
It turns out you have someone outside.

26:31.070 --> 26:31.590
But

26:31.880 --> 26:33.480
Miss Gu looks...

26:34.680 --> 26:35.510
Yuanweng.

26:39.000 --> 26:40.000
Watch your words.

26:40.680 --> 26:41.440
Saying things like that

26:41.440 --> 26:43.700
would ruin the young lady's reputation.

26:43.780 --> 26:46.160
Besides, I still have
to get married someday.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.720
Jiuheng is right.

26:48.480 --> 26:50.210
You had too much to drink today.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.950
Yes. Yes.

26:55.360 --> 26:56.920
Look at my mouth.

26:57.920 --> 26:58.550
I...

26:59.110 --> 27:00.590
I will punish myself with a drink.

27:00.590 --> 27:02.990
I will punish myself
with a drink, Jiuheng.

27:03.310 --> 27:04.510
But Jiuheng,

27:04.510 --> 27:06.790
you really should remarry.

27:07.310 --> 27:09.640
A dignified Grand Secretary living alone,

27:09.640 --> 27:10.770
how inappropriate.

27:11.550 --> 27:13.080
It is also very detrimental

27:13.350 --> 27:14.790
to your career.

27:15.400 --> 27:16.660
You are right, Mentor.

27:16.960 --> 27:17.720
I was

27:17.720 --> 27:19.580
actually just thinking about it.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.440
It's just that

27:21.110 --> 27:22.440
I haven't been able to find

27:22.440 --> 27:23.440
a suitable match.

27:23.880 --> 27:24.510
Is that so?

27:30.270 --> 27:32.720
I have a suitable match for you.

27:34.270 --> 27:36.600
The only daughter of Grand Preceptor Xue.

27:37.110 --> 27:37.960
Her name is

27:38.110 --> 27:38.790
Qinglan.

27:38.920 --> 27:40.200
She's 19,

27:41.110 --> 27:43.720
and my wife's niece.

27:45.030 --> 27:46.720
Actually, my wife and I both think

27:46.720 --> 27:48.320
that you two are a good match.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.400
What do you think?

27:52.790 --> 27:54.550
If you both think so,

27:54.880 --> 27:56.270
then it must be good.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.550
I am

27:58.350 --> 27:59.480
certainly willing.

27:59.640 --> 28:00.200
Good.

28:01.480 --> 28:02.270
Great.

28:02.790 --> 28:04.790
It is exactly the Indian summer now.

28:04.790 --> 28:05.550
My wife

28:05.550 --> 28:07.160
is planning to hold

28:07.400 --> 28:08.510
a Spring Outing.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.550
Firstly, to find a chance

28:10.550 --> 28:11.830
for you two to meet.

28:11.830 --> 28:12.550
Secondly,

28:12.640 --> 28:14.000
and most importantly,

28:15.000 --> 28:18.330
regarding the new tax policy
and maritime grain transport,

28:18.550 --> 28:20.590
now that the national treasury is full,

28:20.590 --> 28:22.960
it should be announced to the world.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.070
Isn't this your idea?

28:33.780 --> 28:35.980
I'll follow your arrangement, Mentor.

28:38.970 --> 28:42.570
[Chen Mansion]

28:45.850 --> 28:52.150
[Thrice Reflections Against Greed;
Ninefold Virtues in the Sound of the Qin]

28:46.920 --> 28:48.780
Third Master, Sixth Miss is here.

28:53.830 --> 28:54.440
Yanyun.

28:54.750 --> 28:55.790
You were looking for me?

28:55.790 --> 28:56.510
What is it?

28:57.160 --> 28:57.890
You're here.

29:00.880 --> 29:02.010
You may leave first.

29:05.920 --> 29:06.550
What?

29:07.070 --> 29:07.830
The Grand Secretary

29:07.830 --> 29:09.560
plans to match you and Qinglan?

29:12.000 --> 29:13.000
Well,

29:13.830 --> 29:16.270
it's not impossible.

29:17.110 --> 29:18.220
What do you think?

29:18.790 --> 29:19.960
I want to ask you,

29:20.230 --> 29:22.230
you're close friends with Miss Xue.

29:22.480 --> 29:23.070
What kind of person

29:23.070 --> 29:24.200
is she exactly?

29:25.070 --> 29:27.830
Qinglan is the only daughter
of Grand Preceptor Xue.

29:27.830 --> 29:30.070
Although she's from
a family of civil officials,

29:30.070 --> 29:32.530
she has loved
martial arts since childhood.

29:32.920 --> 29:33.750
Her family originally

29:33.750 --> 29:35.200
arranged for her to marry the second son

29:35.200 --> 29:36.110
of the Cui family in Baoping.

29:36.110 --> 29:37.790
But before she could
marry into their family,

29:37.790 --> 29:39.400
Young Master Cui died of illness.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.860
She really has a hard life.

29:41.780 --> 29:43.670
I have heard about this.

29:44.350 --> 29:45.750
What is her temperament like?

29:45.750 --> 29:47.150
She is straightforward.

29:47.240 --> 29:48.790
Although her temper isn't great,

29:48.790 --> 29:50.190
she has a very good heart.

29:50.440 --> 29:52.790
She's just too competitive.

29:53.400 --> 29:54.720
She likes martial arts

29:55.200 --> 29:56.160
and often challenges people

29:56.160 --> 29:57.960
to archery and riding contests.

29:58.070 --> 29:59.590
She hates it most when others

29:59.590 --> 30:00.750
let her win on purpose
because she's a woman.

30:00.750 --> 30:01.920
If someone beats her,

30:01.920 --> 30:03.520
it actually makes her happy.

30:06.200 --> 30:08.510
The day after tomorrow
is the Spring Outing.

30:08.510 --> 30:10.000
Who are you planning to invite?

30:10.000 --> 30:11.720
I plan to invite Wanxue to go with me,

30:11.720 --> 30:13.060
as well as Miss Gu.

30:13.640 --> 30:14.640
What do you think?

30:14.750 --> 30:16.200
I was just asking.

30:17.000 --> 30:18.590
You are the one inviting guests,

30:18.590 --> 30:19.400
so you decide.

30:19.920 --> 30:20.510
Alright.

30:22.750 --> 30:24.400
Tomorrow at the foot of Mount Xiuyan,

30:22.840 --> 30:25.750
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

30:24.400 --> 30:26.060
there will be a Spring Outing.

30:26.350 --> 30:27.550
Eldest Miss Xue

30:27.590 --> 30:28.740
and the wife of the Grand Secretary

30:28.740 --> 30:29.680
are co-hosting it.

30:29.680 --> 30:32.400
They invited families of all
the high-ranking officials in the capital.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.560
Wenxiu

30:32.480 --> 30:34.010
[For Miss Gu's Esteemed Perusal]

30:33.580 --> 30:35.110
also sent me an invitation.

30:40.290 --> 30:42.590
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

30:40.400 --> 30:41.200
Grandmother,

30:41.310 --> 30:41.920
look.

30:45.200 --> 30:46.350
This invitation is

30:46.440 --> 30:47.400
[For Miss Gu's Esteemed Perusal]

30:46.510 --> 30:47.750
really exquisite.

30:49.350 --> 30:50.030
Zhao,

30:50.440 --> 30:52.240
I heard you can also ride horses.

30:52.480 --> 30:53.270
Why don't you

30:53.350 --> 30:54.200
take Zhao

30:54.280 --> 30:54.900
and Lan

30:55.030 --> 30:56.240
out to play?

30:56.880 --> 30:57.870
Normally,

30:58.160 --> 30:59.000
they wouldn't have such an opportunity

30:59.000 --> 31:01.060
to meet powerful and wealthy people.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.510
How can I do that?

31:03.960 --> 31:05.860
Wenxiu only invited me.

31:06.200 --> 31:08.130
He didn't say I could bring others.

31:12.830 --> 31:13.550
Old Madam,

31:13.790 --> 31:14.970
here's an invitation
from the Chen Mansion.

31:14.970 --> 31:16.740
[Respectfully Presented to Jinzhao]

31:15.160 --> 31:17.030
The Sixth Miss of the Chen family
invites Eldest Miss

31:17.030 --> 31:19.090
to attend tomorrow's Spring Outing.

31:19.680 --> 31:20.350
Let me see.

31:20.650 --> 31:24.570
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

31:25.880 --> 31:27.540
It's nice of her to think of me.

31:27.790 --> 31:28.470
Lan,

31:28.560 --> 31:29.960
if you are free tomorrow,

31:29.960 --> 31:31.560
you might as well come along.

31:33.300 --> 31:39.950
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

31:34.880 --> 31:35.540
Okay.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.240
Mother.

31:48.540 --> 31:51.420
[Spring Outing]

31:53.490 --> 31:55.730
[Outing]

31:56.650 --> 31:58.350
You look really pretty today.

31:58.510 --> 31:59.160
Really?

31:59.400 --> 32:00.860
My nanny altered it for me.

32:01.160 --> 32:03.360
You're dressed quite plainly, though.

32:03.480 --> 32:05.160
Yeah, I was wondering

32:05.480 --> 32:06.110
why today

32:06.110 --> 32:07.920
everyone is dressed so brightly.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.350
It makes me look unprepared.

32:09.350 --> 32:11.200
It's because this is a rare opportunity.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.350
There are many rules in the capital.

32:12.350 --> 32:13.590
When female family members socialize,

32:13.590 --> 32:15.350
it's usually just visiting
each other's homes.

32:15.350 --> 32:16.430
But when visiting others,

32:16.430 --> 32:18.310
it's inevitable to meet older relatives,

32:18.310 --> 32:19.160
which makes things restricted

32:19.160 --> 32:20.090
and not much fun.

32:20.550 --> 32:21.830
With an event like the Spring Outing,

32:21.830 --> 32:22.640
where there are no elders

32:22.640 --> 32:24.160
and you can play freely,

32:24.270 --> 32:26.200
everyone goes all out dressing up.

32:27.880 --> 32:29.070
Wenxiu!

32:32.130 --> 32:34.170
[Yao Wenxiu, son of Yao Ping]

32:33.960 --> 32:34.640
Lian.

32:41.040 --> 32:42.170
Wenxiu,

32:42.270 --> 32:43.400
I want to go horseback riding.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.790
Let's go pick a horse over there.

32:44.790 --> 32:45.400
Okay.

32:46.400 --> 32:47.550
The stables have many horses.

32:47.550 --> 32:49.150
We can go pick some together.

32:51.320 --> 32:52.890
I don't know how to ride,

32:53.060 --> 32:54.380
so I won't go.

32:54.750 --> 32:56.010
You don't have to ride.

32:56.070 --> 32:57.470
We can just go take a look.

32:58.070 --> 32:59.480
Otherwise, if you stay here alone,

32:59.480 --> 33:00.480
we'd be worried.

33:02.560 --> 33:03.830
Well... alright.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.000
You...

33:08.440 --> 33:08.920
Okay.

33:10.030 --> 33:10.560
Let's go.

33:15.960 --> 33:16.890
Don't be afraid.

33:16.920 --> 33:18.920
Horses are intelligent creatures.

33:20.270 --> 33:21.510
Thank you, Young Master Yao.

33:21.510 --> 33:23.240
Why are you calling me so distantly?

33:23.240 --> 33:24.640
Just call me Wenxiu.

33:27.550 --> 33:28.880
Yes, Wenxiu.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.000
What's wrong?

33:36.480 --> 33:38.480
Why didn't you pick a horse just now?

33:39.000 --> 33:39.590
When I was young,

33:39.590 --> 33:41.190
I fell off a horse.

33:41.310 --> 33:43.770
I haven't dared to
get close to horses since.

33:45.110 --> 33:46.550
A horse is coming over.

33:56.200 --> 33:58.110
This horse seems to know you.

33:59.750 --> 34:01.150
Yeah, sure seems like it.

34:02.350 --> 34:03.350
Do you know me?

34:05.200 --> 34:06.280
I don't know

34:06.310 --> 34:07.680
where it came from.

34:13.190 --> 34:14.510
Xuanqing

34:15.030 --> 34:15.920
is here too.

34:18.190 --> 34:19.250
Young Master Chen?

34:20.000 --> 34:21.000
Why is he here?

34:21.920 --> 34:23.980
I heard he joined the Hanlin Academy.

34:25.320 --> 34:26.780
Why are you blushing?

34:27.440 --> 34:28.230
I...

34:30.230 --> 34:31.510
I'm engaged to him.

34:32.320 --> 34:33.190
Congratulations.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.520
When did it happen?

34:34.840 --> 34:36.250
Before the metropolitan examination.

34:36.250 --> 34:37.820
You are really lucky.

34:38.110 --> 34:40.460
He placed third
in the imperial examination.

34:40.460 --> 34:42.090
Stop making fun of me.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.480
He's here.

34:53.030 --> 34:53.770
Miss Gu.

34:54.000 --> 34:55.060
Young Master Chen.

34:58.060 --> 34:58.660
Miss Yu.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.670
Xuanqing.

35:04.990 --> 35:06.060
Young Master Chen.

35:06.080 --> 35:07.340
Hope you've been well.

35:08.260 --> 35:09.300
Take your time.

35:09.510 --> 35:11.510
I can't wait to go horseback riding.

35:20.190 --> 35:20.920
I'm leaving.

35:21.150 --> 35:21.680
Let's go.

35:23.880 --> 35:24.320
Hyah!

35:25.510 --> 35:26.000
Hyah!

35:29.280 --> 35:31.010
A lot of people are practicing.

35:31.140 --> 35:36.230
[Outing]

35:31.510 --> 35:32.320
Wenxiu,

35:32.440 --> 35:33.300
let's play too.

35:33.920 --> 35:35.180
I'm going to the field,

35:35.960 --> 35:37.370
but you shouldn't go.

35:36.630 --> 35:37.140
[Outing]

35:37.670 --> 35:38.890
As a girl,

35:39.000 --> 35:40.280
if you fall,

35:40.360 --> 35:42.620
you'll make a fool of yourself in public.

35:43.550 --> 35:44.360
Yao!

35:45.230 --> 35:45.760
Zan?

35:45.800 --> 35:46.330
Let's go,

35:46.400 --> 35:47.460
get some practice.

35:47.800 --> 35:48.280
Let's go.

35:48.280 --> 35:48.810
Let's go.

36:04.920 --> 36:05.550
I'm warning you.

36:05.550 --> 36:07.100
Stay away from Wenxiu.

36:07.510 --> 36:08.760
If you act

36:08.760 --> 36:09.480
like a seductress again,

36:09.480 --> 36:10.710
I won't let you off easily.

36:10.710 --> 36:11.950
Don't talk nonsense.

36:12.280 --> 36:13.480
What seductress?

36:13.550 --> 36:14.760
I haven't even said

36:14.760 --> 36:15.550
two words to Wenxiu.

36:15.550 --> 36:17.810
Who gave you the right to call him Wenxiu?

36:18.710 --> 36:19.510
What's wrong?

36:27.150 --> 36:28.380
Look at you.

36:28.550 --> 36:29.810
You're doing it again.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.000
Doing what?

36:31.020 --> 36:32.600
She didn't even say anything.

36:32.600 --> 36:33.600
Don't bully her.

36:33.920 --> 36:35.360
Me bullying her?

36:35.670 --> 36:36.760
She's obviously pretending

36:36.760 --> 36:37.840
to be pitiful

36:37.960 --> 36:38.880
to seduce you.

36:39.280 --> 36:40.760
When did I ever seduce him?

36:41.280 --> 36:42.080
It was obviously him...

36:42.080 --> 36:43.030
Alright, alright.

36:43.030 --> 36:43.830
Stop arguing.

36:45.320 --> 36:45.720
You...

36:47.070 --> 36:48.550
Wenxiu.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.560
In previous years,

37:03.630 --> 37:05.000
we wouldn't have had so much money

37:05.000 --> 37:06.930
to hold such a grand Spring Outing.

37:07.110 --> 37:08.200
The imperial court

37:08.440 --> 37:09.710
is wealthy now.

37:09.880 --> 37:10.760
Yes.

37:11.280 --> 37:13.350
This is all thanks to Xuanweng

37:13.400 --> 37:15.390
and the new tax policy.

37:17.840 --> 37:18.510
I heard the rules for today’s

37:18.510 --> 37:20.030
archery contest
have been changed as well.

37:20.030 --> 37:22.120
Men and women are competing together.

37:22.120 --> 37:23.920
Isn't this a bit inappropriate?

37:24.360 --> 37:26.160
What's inappropriate about it?

37:27.450 --> 37:30.560
[Xue Qinglan, daughter
of Grand Preceptor Xue]

37:28.880 --> 37:30.010
Riding and shooting

37:30.020 --> 37:31.840
rely on horsemanship and accuracy.

37:31.840 --> 37:33.670
It has nothing to do
with physical strength or endurance.

37:33.670 --> 37:36.000
Why can't men and women compete together?

37:41.320 --> 37:42.920
You are right, Miss.

37:43.280 --> 37:44.880
I was biased.

37:45.190 --> 37:47.050
You changed your tune quite fast.

37:50.670 --> 37:51.730
Greetings, Uncle.

37:52.840 --> 37:53.400
Aunt.

37:55.800 --> 37:57.030
How is your father?

37:58.670 --> 38:00.190
My father had too much
to drink again today.

38:00.190 --> 38:01.240
He was afraid you'd scold him,

38:01.240 --> 38:02.640
so he didn't dare to come.

38:06.030 --> 38:07.840
The wind passing through the forest

38:07.840 --> 38:09.110
has actually blown away the heaviness

38:09.110 --> 38:10.090
in my heart.

38:10.760 --> 38:12.030
Since my mother passed away,

38:12.030 --> 38:12.590
I haven't had

38:12.590 --> 38:14.050
such a relaxing moment.

38:14.840 --> 38:16.480
Only by knowing the vastness of the world,

38:16.480 --> 38:17.940
do old sorrows feel light.

38:18.880 --> 38:19.510
Indeed.

38:19.670 --> 38:21.510
Since the green mountains are so charming,

38:21.510 --> 38:22.070
why should I

38:22.070 --> 38:24.130
still cling to the storms of the past?

38:27.080 --> 38:28.460
Are you going that way?

38:34.070 --> 38:34.760
Make way!

38:41.090 --> 38:42.100
Slow down!

38:45.630 --> 38:46.690
What are you doing?

39:27.830 --> 39:29.360
I know you're in a hurry,

39:29.510 --> 39:31.300
but if you always think about

39:31.400 --> 39:33.190
throwing me off and walking by yourself,

39:33.190 --> 39:34.360
that's your fault.

39:34.510 --> 39:35.210
You know?

39:35.670 --> 39:36.320
If you do this

39:36.320 --> 39:37.350
again next time,

39:37.920 --> 39:39.530
I'll have to whip you again.

39:40.880 --> 39:41.410
Alright,

39:41.510 --> 39:41.960
go.

39:55.710 --> 39:56.920
Chen Yanyun?

39:59.480 --> 40:00.820
Who is this woman?

40:03.070 --> 40:04.070
Look, look, look.

40:04.190 --> 40:04.550
So...

40:04.710 --> 40:05.670
So this horse

40:05.670 --> 40:07.600
came here for a marriage match too.

40:09.070 --> 40:10.230
And it just so happens to be the same day

40:10.230 --> 40:11.030
as Jiuheng's.

40:12.630 --> 40:13.540
Jiuheng,

40:13.590 --> 40:15.000
isn't that black horse

40:15.190 --> 40:16.250
yours?

40:18.760 --> 40:19.710
Yes, Mentor.

40:20.030 --> 40:21.030
That brown

40:21.030 --> 40:22.690
Yuhuacong steed is also mine.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.320
Somehow,

40:24.590 --> 40:26.050
Miss Gu ended up riding it.

40:36.710 --> 40:37.530
Isn't she

40:37.630 --> 40:39.440
the lady boss of Linxia Restaurant?

40:39.440 --> 40:40.150
Yes.

40:40.670 --> 40:41.320
Jiuheng,

40:41.800 --> 40:42.400
your surbordinate

40:42.400 --> 40:44.130
was so well-behaved last time.

40:44.280 --> 40:45.320
Why didn't she

40:45.400 --> 40:46.440
greet you today?

40:46.920 --> 40:48.500
That's just her temper.

40:48.710 --> 40:50.510
Probably the horse annoyed her,

40:51.030 --> 40:51.960
so she got angry.

40:52.320 --> 40:54.320
You are afraid of her getting angry?

40:54.550 --> 40:55.760
Are you the master,

40:55.760 --> 40:57.110
or is she the master?

41:04.480 --> 41:05.320
I'm so mad!

41:05.760 --> 41:08.160
The more I think about it,
the angrier I get.

41:08.320 --> 41:10.050
I told you to find noble ladies,

41:10.070 --> 41:11.850
but I didn't tell you to go so early.

41:11.850 --> 41:13.630
You just went to Tongzhou
the day before yesterday,

41:13.630 --> 41:15.960
and today you are
discussing marriage here.

41:15.960 --> 41:16.640
Men.

41:19.590 --> 41:20.320
Zhao.

41:21.190 --> 41:22.610
Didn't you go horseback riding?

41:22.610 --> 41:23.570
Why are you back?

41:25.030 --> 41:26.230
That horse is no good.

41:26.440 --> 41:27.700
It has a fierce temper.

41:29.920 --> 41:30.840
I'm a little tired,

41:30.840 --> 41:32.240
and want to go back first.

41:32.360 --> 41:33.960
I just wanted to let you know.

41:34.440 --> 41:35.700
You want to go back now?

41:35.800 --> 41:37.000
Then I'll go back too.

41:38.110 --> 41:38.710
Let's go.

41:42.070 --> 41:43.280
You ride a horse well.

41:44.150 --> 41:45.350
What's your name?

41:45.630 --> 41:46.550
The archery contest is about to begin.

41:46.550 --> 41:47.950
Let's compete together.

41:48.440 --> 41:48.960
No need.

41:49.590 --> 41:50.440
Why not?

41:51.440 --> 41:52.550
Looking at you,

41:52.800 --> 41:53.710
you don't seem like the type

41:53.710 --> 41:55.550
who is strictly controlled by your family.

41:55.550 --> 41:57.010
Are you afraid to compete?

41:57.150 --> 41:58.150
Afraid of losing?

41:58.590 --> 41:59.720
I am perfectly fine.

42:00.000 --> 42:02.030
Why would I go down
there and get all sweaty,

42:02.030 --> 42:03.780
just to be pointed at?

42:04.070 --> 42:05.130
What's in it for me?

42:05.280 --> 42:06.140
For the prizes!

42:06.920 --> 42:07.920
Among today's prizes,

42:07.920 --> 42:08.920
there's a Ferghana horse

42:08.920 --> 42:09.850
and a fine sword.

42:10.150 --> 42:12.150
They're both incredibly valuable.

42:12.760 --> 42:14.150
So what if they're valuable?

42:14.150 --> 42:15.320
I don't care about them.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.000
Don't go.

42:16.550 --> 42:17.840
I'm not feeling well.

42:18.150 --> 42:20.360
I don't think you're physically unwell.

42:20.360 --> 42:21.920
You have something
on your mind, don't you?

42:21.920 --> 42:23.180
But it doesn't matter.

42:23.550 --> 42:25.680
Go down, ride a bit, shoot a few arrows,

42:26.590 --> 42:27.920
and you'll feel better.

42:28.960 --> 42:30.150
Thanks for the suggestion.

42:30.150 --> 42:31.080
Maybe next time.

42:31.800 --> 42:33.110
It's rare for me to see a woman

42:33.110 --> 42:34.550
whose riding skills are as good as mine.

42:34.550 --> 42:36.410
I bet your archery is just as good.

42:36.840 --> 42:37.440
Let's go down

42:37.440 --> 42:38.700
and have a match later.

42:40.480 --> 42:41.590
I told you, no need.

42:42.000 --> 42:43.930
It's not just for the competition.

42:45.000 --> 42:47.000
The guests today
are all families of civil officials.

42:47.000 --> 42:48.320
Civil officials only care
for poetry and refinement,

42:48.320 --> 42:49.440
and are not good at riding and archery.

42:49.440 --> 42:50.440
Since they don't like it,

42:50.440 --> 42:52.440
they naturally won't
let their daughters learn it.

42:52.440 --> 42:53.800
I specially organized

42:53.800 --> 42:55.930
this mixed-gender competition today

42:56.030 --> 42:56.590
just to show

42:56.590 --> 42:58.070
those men

42:58.590 --> 43:00.550
that we women riding and shooting

43:00.710 --> 43:01.840
are just as capable.

43:03.840 --> 43:04.620
If you ask me,

43:04.800 --> 43:05.670
competing

43:05.800 --> 43:07.510
just for prizes is boring.

43:08.190 --> 43:09.850
Why don't we change the prizes

43:10.070 --> 43:10.920
into cash?

43:12.000 --> 43:13.110
Let's put all the cash

43:13.110 --> 43:14.190
into a pool,

43:14.590 --> 43:17.070
and donate it all
to Hall of Benevolence after the match.

43:17.070 --> 43:18.130
Whoever wins

43:18.360 --> 43:20.290
will have it donated in their name.

43:21.070 --> 43:22.230
That's a good idea.

43:22.760 --> 43:23.670
This way,

43:23.670 --> 43:25.110
persuading those men

43:25.110 --> 43:26.230
will be justified.

43:27.440 --> 43:28.510
I'll use your method.

43:28.510 --> 43:29.910
Would you like to join me?

43:30.550 --> 43:31.280
Of course.

43:31.670 --> 43:32.070
Good.

43:32.320 --> 43:34.120
I'll take you to change clothes.

43:34.400 --> 43:35.110
-Let’s go.
-Let’s go.

43:35.110 --> 43:35.640
Let's go.

43:47.780 --> 43:49.420
You really invited her here.

43:49.670 --> 43:50.280
Of course.

43:50.510 --> 43:51.590
When I step in myself,

43:51.590 --> 43:52.630
how could I fail?

43:54.920 --> 43:56.570
Are you going to play today?

43:56.710 --> 43:57.280
Yes.

43:57.480 --> 43:58.440
Qinglan asked me

43:58.440 --> 43:59.190
to practice half a month ago.

43:59.190 --> 44:00.150
If I don don't play,

44:00.150 --> 44:01.590
she won't let me off.

44:01.840 --> 44:02.440
All right.

44:02.550 --> 44:03.680
You practice first.

44:04.000 --> 44:04.550
I'll go over there

44:04.550 --> 44:05.750
and invite those men.

44:06.110 --> 44:07.480
Remember to invite
my third brother, Yanyun.

44:07.480 --> 44:08.480
Want to see him lose to me?

44:08.480 --> 44:09.070
Yes.

44:15.400 --> 44:16.630
She always thought Yanyun

44:16.630 --> 44:17.920
is a weak scholar

44:17.920 --> 44:19.060
who does no physical labor.

44:19.060 --> 44:19.920
Wait and see how Yanyun

44:19.920 --> 44:21.120
surprises her later.

44:21.840 --> 44:23.170
From what I saw earlier,

44:23.190 --> 44:25.400
something felt rather odd between

44:25.590 --> 44:27.140
Third Master and Miss Xue.

44:27.440 --> 44:28.480
What could be odd?

44:28.480 --> 44:29.710
Madam Fu played matchmaker

44:29.710 --> 44:31.460
to set Yanyun and Qinglan up.

44:31.800 --> 44:32.590
Actually,

44:32.820 --> 44:34.480
I think they are quite a match.

44:34.480 --> 44:35.550
Yanyun is sly,

44:35.670 --> 44:37.600
and Qinglan is like a firecracker.

44:38.030 --> 44:39.150
Indeed sly.

44:51.780 --> 44:55.300
[A Splendid Match]
